OL,3,GNEWSA'Dramatic action' needed after NHS
OL,4,AGrampian leaders criticised in damning
OL,5,Areport - Swinney
OL,6,
OL,7,FFirst Minister John Swinney has called
OL,8,Ffor "dramatic action" to be taken after
OL,9,Fa healthcare watchdog issued a damning
OL,10,Freport into failures by senior
OL,11,Fleadership at NHS Grampian.
OL,13,FHealthcare Improvement Scotland (HIS)
OL,14,Ffound "major deficiencies" across the
OL,15,Fregion and revealed that a failure to
OL,16,Flearn from mistakes had caused
OL,17,F"repeated and unavoidable harm" to
OL,18,Fpatients.
OL,23,APub: 12-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
FL,424,420,260,160,0,100
