OL,3,GNEWSA'Dramatic action' needed after NHS
OL,4,AGrampian leaders criticised in damning
OL,5,Areport - Swinney
OL,6,
OL,7,FIt also said it had lost confidence in
OL,8,Fmanagement to deliver reliable and
OL,9,Fconsistent information after Dr Gray's
OL,10,FHospital in Elgin continued to operate
OL,11,Fon children despite an order to halt
OL,12,Fall paediatric surgery.
OL,14,FNHS Grampian chief executive Laura
OL,15,FSkaife-Knight said the board accepted
OL,16,Fthe findings and apologised to
OL,17,Fpatients.
